2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	session.run() and the data of output tensors (PoC task 3), first
	version from the nemotron harness session, run() rewritten after
	review.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_session_run):
	New. run(feeds, outputNames?) maps input names to Tensor objects,
	calls ORT Run and returns an object of output tensors. Unknown or
	missing inputs, a non-Tensor input, bad outputNames and a released
	session throw. One cleanup label frees the name and value arrays,
	the property table and every output value that was not wrapped yet.
	The first version leaked its arrays on every error path and printed
	names after freeing them.

