	The value is released on every failure path, as the contract says.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_tensor_get_data, js_ort_view_free):
	The data of an output tensor is a new Float32Array view over the ORT
	memory, no copy, with a reference to the tensor that keeps it valid.

